# Paths the secret scanner should skip entirely (in addition to the
# built-in skip list — node_modules, dist, coverage, .git, lock files,
# tests/.evidence, tests/.tmp, etc).
#
# One glob per line. `*` matches one path segment, `**` matches any
# number. Lines starting with `#` are comments. Paths are repo-relative
# with forward slashes.
#
# Prefer an inline `secret-scan: allow` marker on a single line over
# adding a whole file here — file-level ignores are blunt and easy to
# forget about.

# The scanner's own self-tests embed example tokens on purpose.
artifacts/api-server/tests/security/**
